  "path": "PDF path operators (m l c h S s f rg RG q Q) copied from the user's reference print map, in its units of 0.04 mm on paper, y up. anchor 'origin': the symbol's own origin sits on the map point (the base of a tree, a mast's dot). Printed at the reference's paper size at 1:25 000 and scaled like the other icons at other scales; the style's icon-size does not apply. Lines are 0.1 mm.",
  "layers": "Each layer is {rgb: [r, g, b], ops: [...]}. ops: ['seg', [[x, y], ...], width] round-capped polyline; ['bar', [x, y], [x, y], width] butt-capped line; ['poly', [[x, y], ...]] filled polygon; ['disc', cx, cy, r] filled circle; ['ring', cx, cy, r, width] stroked circle."
